# Allowlist: ignore everything, then admit only what the Dockerfile copies.
# This keeps .env, mcp_agent.secrets.yaml, credentials/, workflow_state.json,
# logs, .venv and publish/ out of the build context entirely.
*
!requirements.txt
!run_tweet_processor.py
!mcp_agent.config.yaml
!src/
!scripts/convert_docx_to_md.py
!data/articles.md
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
